        <mxCell id="30" value="WHY 44 WORDS (For Standard 10-Round AES-128)?&#10;&#10;• 10 Rounds × 4 Words per Round  =  40 Words&#10;• Plus 4 Words for the Initial 'Add Round Key' step before Round 1  =  44 Words Total&#10;• In Our App (AES-256 with 14 Rounds): Same idea — expands to 60 Words (Key 0 .. Key 14)." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#F4F6F8;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14.5;fontColor=#111827;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
